FA4 b37 preserves mixed-sign offset windows after upstream PR #2490:
https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention/pull/2490
TE's causal (-1, 0) must become (None, 0), not an empty local window.
Only the FA4 path changes; FA2/FA3 keep their existing argument convention.

